{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9829.249541000001,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10222.513694000001,"text":"But after losing their wicket captain, India scored only 36 runs and lost seven wickets, ending the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10277.127708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10281.676003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10286.79966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10292.039776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10297.210453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":10303.03504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":10303.634501,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19807.338248,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":20165.46224,"text":"They usually have a special offer of food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests happy and ensure they stay."},{"kind":"audio","t":20217.326443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":20222.638697000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":20227.791084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20233.220577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20238.337774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20240.825119,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":29195.92334,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29638.188626,"text":"Del Potro took an early lead in the second set, but once again a tie-break was needed after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":29692.643932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29697.943137000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29703.043925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29708.401389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29713.663574000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29716.554613,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":41558.762913,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":41786.744044,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass communication as well as interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":41836.30932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41841.525286000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":41846.548014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41851.894748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41857.282382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":41857.446209,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":55020.444723,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden, wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektropos bedacht."},{"kind":"text","t":55417.815417,"text":"The composition of these crystals corresponds to the composition found in the urine of affected pets when analyzed using an infrared spectrometer."},{"kind":"audio","t":55472.481131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55477.531859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55482.879823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":55488.149588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55493.168697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55498.483831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55503.906934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55505.801927,"samples":21424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":64296.421766,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64641.63794099999,"text":"On some routes, larger companies use their own aircraft, but difficulties arose on other routes with smaller companies."},{"kind":"audio","t":64690.83453199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":64692.380170000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64694.158895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":64695.976269000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64697.921461000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64699.793294999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":64699.966352,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":72067.403582,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":72350.561089,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they decay even with minimal or no stimulation."},{"kind":"audio","t":72402.088307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":72407.389792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":72412.84192400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72418.205758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":72423.580522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":72424.718405,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":86621.323964,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen."},{"kind":"text","t":87012.551925,"text":"That same month, another passenger plane flew off the end of a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall."},{"kind":"audio","t":87064.164311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87069.690693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87075.316823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87080.711076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":87085.959662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87088.817561,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":89394.944115,"text":"wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89581.587923,"text":"17 people lost their lives in the incident."},{"kind":"audio","t":89628.699353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89633.710532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89637.217172,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":103195.49692,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103576.539726,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions, and most provide shade from pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":103629.532533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103634.862838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103639.914286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":103645.198681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103650.578844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103653.077379,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":114325.645378,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":114805.434791,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":114860.528718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114865.718304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114870.881071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114876.020228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114881.300733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114886.42605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114891.892522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114895.705728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":114895.861386,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":122257.434539,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":122545.410738,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses did not hold such great significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":122592.931273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122598.106559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":122603.516552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122608.818537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122610.248956,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":131085.697793,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131433.098537,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":131481.382721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131486.749805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131492.259486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131497.895076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131498.186172,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":131552.55981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131554.026179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":131555.511418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131557.103545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":131557.406591,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138174.861347,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":138534.478567,"text":"The color of the cabbage juice changes depending on whether the chemical is acidic or basic/alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":138585.574651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138590.870666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138596.304249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138601.535835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138606.81648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":138608.035682,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147607.918358,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen. Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":147935.414085,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to begin full operation in September 2017. It is expected that the Brazilian customs posts will be completed by then."},{"kind":"audio","t":147985.258216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147990.739548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147995.859896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148001.335128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":148002.509601,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":148055.166973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148060.741614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148066.332294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148070.938079,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":158387.614235,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":158763.353096,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer."},{"kind":"audio","t":158812.776744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158814.335952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158815.628933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158817.2754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158818.883107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158819.618937,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":164531.828845,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164764.349951,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the governor-general’s office building."},{"kind":"audio","t":164805.23775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164806.790428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164808.451385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164808.77418,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":173332.475221,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173812.921865,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city as Daelbeda, and it was named Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading posts there."},{"kind":"audio","t":173864.338424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173865.782984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173867.246483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173868.919179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":173870.565546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173872.131974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173873.396966,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":186556.420029,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs,"},{"kind":"text","t":187042.645521,"text":"He was greeted by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister, and spoke with Lee Hsing-Long, Singapore’s Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":187096.770662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187101.984528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":187107.41143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187112.614897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187117.931411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187123.082918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187128.145476,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":187797.087141,"text":"über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187925.214301,"text":"on trade and terrorism issues."},{"kind":"audio","t":187965.282111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187970.913521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":187971.065149,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":200692.27475,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":200937.869741,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required."},{"kind":"audio","t":200982.090543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200987.16477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200992.754701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200995.874417,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":201919.295126,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":202134.945812,"text":"to form a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":202179.909373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202185.304377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202190.484563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":202190.666671,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207311.315774,"text":"Für die Archipel und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207568.777136,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":207613.596089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207619.095471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207624.457855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207625.630308,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217706.10877,"code":1005}]}